EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame_Text_HereWeHonorLeagueChampions::
    .string "The static fades. The sky is real.\p"
    .string "TAI and MATT are home in their\n"
    .string "original universe at last.\p"
    .string "AGUMON and GABUMON stand beside them.\n"
    .string "The glitch world can no longer\l"
    .string "keep anyone trapped.$"
EverGrandeCity_HallOfFame_Text_LetsRecordYouAndYourPartnersNames::
    .string "MATT: We made it, Tai.\p"
    .string "TAI: Because we never gave up\n"
    .string "on each other.\p"
    .string "Your journey and your partners\n"
    .string "will always be remembered.$"
